uction and a secure point harness to keep your baby safe while traveling. Soft & Cozy Interior: Padded cushioning and breathable fabric ensure your baby stays comfortable and snug. Portable & Lightweight: Easy to carry with a comfortable handle, perfect for travel or daily outings. Multi-Functional Design: Doubles as a car seat, rocker, or stationary seat for ultimate versatility. Compact & Space-Saving: Lightweight and foldable for easy storage when not in use. Stylish Appearance: Sleek, modern design that suits all parents\' tastes while keeping functionality in mind. Easy to Clean: Removable, washable cover makes maintaining hygiene effortless.',0,0,1,'2026-11-25 07:33:31','[\"#172554\",\"#1E40AF\",\"#60A5FA\"]'),('02218000-6655-4880-9ef5-1a305da2e730','PEPTIDE COMPLEX','VNT-BTY-0162','VANTA BTY','beauty',10.00,NULL,52,'[\"/uploads/vnt-bty-0162-img-1.webp\",\"/uploads/vnt-bty-0162-img-2.webp\"]','PEPTIDE COMPLEX','PEPTIDE COMPLEX: Advanced eye gel formula enriched with peptides helps reduce the appearance of dark circles and puffiness around the eyesTARGETED TREATMENT: Specially formulated eye moisturiser designed for men\'s under-eye area to address fine lines and signs of fatigueQUICK ABSORPTION: Lightweight gel texture absorbs rapidly into the skin without leaving any greasy residue or heavy feelingCONVENIENT PACKAGING: Comes in an easy-to-use tube with precision tip applicator for controlled dispensing and hygienic applicationDAILY USE: Suitable for morning and evening application as part of regular skincare routine for optimal results',0,0,0,'2026-11-25 07:29:31','[\"#0F172A\",\"#334155\",\"#94A3B8\"]'),('027073af-acb8-4116-a32d-5c7e85507491','B792 4e67 9ea7f321aaba','VNT-WLN-0584','VANTA WLN','wellness',15.00,12.00,84,'[\"/uploads/vnt-wln-0584-img-1.webp\",\"/uploads/vnt-wln-0584-img-2.webp\"]','B792 4e67 9ea7f321aaba','Herbal Lung Cleanse Mist is a powerful lung support spray designed to alleviate lung discomfort and promote respiratory health. Made from 1