ng/Measuring Cup with a 1/4 cup capacity (approx. 60g), so your corn will be perfectly buttered every time. Safety is our priority. Remember, when the corn maker is in action, the interior surface gets hot. So keep those hands safe and avoid touching them. Customize your corn with flavors! This mini hot-aircorn maker can handle about 50-70 grams of corn in one go. But if you\'re hankering for more, wait just 10-12 minutes before your next corn session. ? Keep in mind, this is a hot air corn machine. Don\'t go overboard with butter and sugar directly in the chamber. Wait until your corn is \"safe and sound\" in the bowl, and then let your creativity run wild with condensed milk, butter, caramel, or anything your taste buds desire. Sometimes a few kernels might hang back, but that\'s perfectly normal. No need to stress! Safety first! Our QuickCorn Mini Hot Air Corn Maker is equipped with built-in overheating protection. It\'ll automatically power off if things get too toasty. What\'s in the package: - 1 QuickCorn Mini Hot Air Corn Maker with EU Plug Please note: - This package includes only the items mentioned above. Other products are not included. Bring the carnival to your kitchen with the QuickCorn Mini Hot Air Corn Maker! Your snack time will never be the same. Grab yours now! ?',1,0,0,'2026-11-25 07:32:44','[\"#065F46\",\"#10B981\",\"#A7F3D0\"]'),('146a18b7-bf5f-408b-bb5f-c16cf634faa2','Long-Lasting Performance','VNT-ELE-0085','VANTA ELE','electronics',50.00,40.00,40,'[\"/uploads/vnt-ele-0085-img-1.webp\",\"/uploads/vnt-ele-0085-img-2.webp\"]','Long-Lasting Performance','Long-Lasting Performance: Built-In Large Capacity Battery: Ensures extended work periods, allowing you to rely on your headlamp for long camping trips, night hikes, or fishing expeditions without frequent recharges. Weather Resistant: IPX6 Rating: Designed to withstand harsh weather conditions, including heavy rain and snow, making it a reliable companion in all kinds of outdoor environments. Wi