or. ?EASY TO USE?: The windshield chip repair kit is easy to use. Firstly, clean and dry the glass surface of the windshield. Secondly, squeeze the resin into the cracks and apply it to the treated film, then dry it quickly and harden it under UV light for 5-10 minutes. Finally, scrape off the remaining resin with a flat spatula ?Wide Application?: This windshield repair kit repairs all types of laminated windshields such as eye damage, cracks, chips, star chips and spider webs. Cracks no larger than 12 inches/30cm in diameter and round damage no larger than 1 inch in diameter. If you are not satisfied in any way, please feel free to contact us',0,0,0,'2026-11-25 07:29:48','[\"#18181B\",\"#71717A\",\"#E4E4E7\"]'),('3a6ef77c-96d6-4fe5-83d8-c95924b8a896','Full Circle Cleaning','VNT-ELE-0087','VANTA ELE','electronics',27.00,NULL,42,'[\"/uploads/vnt-ele-0087-img-1.webp\",\"/uploads/vnt-ele-0087-img-2.webp\"]','Full Circle Cleaning','Full Circle Cleaning: Professional Jewelry Cleaning Machine Efficient Cleaning: Clean dirty jewelry in minutes using only tap water. (For better results, add some liquid dish soap or Kunphy cleaning solution.) Portable Size: Portable Ultrasonic Jewelry Cleaner: Stainless steel chamber with accommodating jewelry, glasses, and various accessories. Compact and Lightweight: ultrasonic cleaner that deeply cleans every angle of your items. Easy to Use: User-Friendly Design: Features overheat protection and a one-touch button with indicator for simple operation. Smart Cleaning: Flashing red indicator light reminds you when overheating to avoid damaging the machine. Low Noise Design: Quiet Operation: High-end waterproof surface finish and SUS stainless steel tank ensure durability with minimal noise. Durable Build: Stainless steel tank provides corrosion resistance, allowing the use of any detergent or ultrasonic solution with peace of mind. Versatile Cleaner: Multi-Purpose: Suitable for cleaning jewelry, rings, glasses, dentures, watch coins, and m