air for a smooth, manageable finish. Damage Repair: Protects against split ends and breakage caused by styling or environmental stress. Quick Absorption: Lightweight formula penetrates deeply without leaving residue. Suitable for All Hair Types: Whether dry, oily, or normal, this formula works wonders.',0,0,0,'2026-11-25 07:29:44','[\"#065F46\",\"#10B981\",\"#A7F3D0\"]'),('587b299f-5c6a-4ec3-a4c9-b29fe4db3522','Introducing Silicone Kitchenware','VNT-HME-0454','VANTA HME','home-decor',30.00,25.00,84,'[\"/uploads/vnt-hme-0454-img-1.webp\",\"/uploads/vnt-hme-0454-img-2.webp\"]','Introducing Silicone Kitchenware','Introducing Silicone Kitchenware: Soft and Comfortable: The silicone material provides a soft and comfortable grip, ensuring ease of use during cooking and food preparation. Easy to Clean: The non-stick surface of silicone makes it easy to clean by hand or in the dishwasher, saving you time and effort in the kitchen. High Temperature Resistance: These kitchenware items are designed to withstand high temperatures, ranging from 40°C to 230°C, making them suitable for various cooking methods and oven use. Heat-Resisting: With heat-resistance properties, these silicone kitchenware items can safely handle hot pots, pans, and cooking surfaces without warping or melting, ensuring durability and longevity in the kitchen. 12 Silicone Kitchen Utensils Set: This professional set includes an egg whisk, solid spatula, slotted spatula, solid spoon, slotted spoon, pasta server, kitchen tongs, mixing scraper, mixing spoon, soup ladle, oil brush, and utensils holder, meeting all your daily cooking needs. Safe and Eco-friendly: Made of food-grade silicone materials with FDA certification, these utensils are BPA-free, lead-free, non-toxic, non-stick, healthy, and safe. The natural wooden handles are durable and won\'t break, melt, or rust. Natural Wood Handle: The beech wood handles are comfortable to hold and have a hanging hole design for convenient storage. Durable & Heat Resistant: These kitchen gadgets are heat resistant up to 446°F (240°C), microwave-safe, and won\'t melt. The soft silicone won\'t scratch your non-stick cookware, prolonging the life of your utensils. Easy to Clean: Thanks to the non-adhesive nature of silicone, these utensils are easy to clean. Simply rinse under water or place them in the dishwasher. After cleaning, let them dry before storing them in the holder.',0,0,0,'2026-11-25 07:32:50','[\"#78350F\",\"#F59E0B\",\"#FDE68A\"]'),('5899d3b4-099a-45ab-9e4c-fba2edb17274','Hardware-Level Auto Cut-Off Protection','VNT-ELE-0014','VANTA ELE','electronics',26.00,20.00,34,'[\"/uploads/vnt-ele-0014-img-1.webp\",\"/uploads/vnt-ele-0014-img-2.webp\"]','Hardware-Level Auto Cut-Off Protection','【Hardware-Level Auto Cut-Off Protection】Unlike conventional software-based chargers that rely on trickle charging, our built-in AI chip triggers a physical relay disconnect once full capacity is reached. This completely cuts off current flow, eliminating risks of battery swelling and overheating for safe, worry-free overnight charging.【140W Universal Fast-Charging Engine】Supports full power output up to 140W with native compatibility for major charging protocols including PD and QC. This high-efficiency system delivers full-speed charging across all Type-C devices, from high-performance workstations to everyday smartphones, without compromising your original charging speed.【Dual-Mode Smart Sensing System】Our intelligent dual-current detection adapts automatically to different power needs: White mode optimizes delivery for laptops and tablets, while Blue mode provides precise, gentle protection for smaller accessories like power banks and portable fans. Enjoy tailored safety for every device you charge.【Protective Memory Silicone Interface】The built-in memory silicone padding creates a soft buffer at every connection, eliminating metal-on-metal friction to safeguard your device’s charging port. This anti-scratch layer maintains a secure, non-slip grip while keeping the port of your high-end electronics in pristine condition.【Ultra-Compact Fire-Resistant Build】Lightweight at only 0.8 ounces and smaller than a matchbox, this travel-friendly adapter is perfect for on-the-go use. It’s constructed with flame-retardant PC material for superior heat resistance, ensuring reliable performance even during extended charging sessions.',1,0,0,'2026-11-25 07:29:02','[\"#312E81\",\"#6366F1\",\"#C7D2FE\"]'),('589d4f56-1f63-4f24-bd97-9b6f5044fd3d','Doublefaced Glass Cleaner Magnetic','VNT-HME-0475','VANTA HME','home-decor',14.00,11.00,40,'[\"/uploads/vnt-hme-0475-img-1.webp\",\"/uploads/vnt-hme-0475-img-2.webp\"]','Doublefaced Glass Cleaner Magnetic','Magnetic Window Cleaner for Double Glazed Windows 5-12mm Thickness Note: Glass in different thickness should be used on different magnetic glass wipers, otherwise it cannot move or fall off the glass. Be sure to apply detergent to the cleaning cotton. Slowly move the magnetic window cleaner during use, as the slower the moving speed, the better the cleaning effect. Unique Modern Design - Triangular Shape Say goodbye to risky window cleaning with our powerful double-sided magnetic window cleaner! The triangular shape allows easy access to narrow areas and eliminates dead corners, making high-rise windows cleaning a breeze! High-Quality Materials for Safer Use Our magnetic window cleaner is crafted with high-quality ABS material, natural latex, and strong magnets, ensuring good strength, high toughness, and a more solid texture. You can clean with confidence and safety. Built-in Water Storage Sponge No more frequent water replenishment! The magnetic window cleaner features a built-in water storage sponge, ensuring long-lasting use and making cleaning a breeze! Wide Application - Perfect for Home & Car This magnetic window cleaner is perfect for 5-12mm double glazed surfaces, whether it\'s home windows, car windows, sliding doors, or shower screens. Keep your windows sparkling and clear effortlessly! More Secure with Anti-Falling Rope Safety first! Our magnetic window cleaner comes with 2 long anti-falling ropes, ensuring a secure grip while cleaning. Tie the rope to your hand for added peace of mind and wipe your glass more securely! Make your window cleaning a breeze with our double-sided magnetic window cleaner! Add to your cart now and enjoy a crystal-clear view!',0,1,0,'2026-11-25 07:32:59','[\"#172554\",\"#1E40AF\",\"#60A5FA\"]'),('58d684e9-d08d-4c86-a376-92a9549b8943','Introducing the multi-talented Ceramic Air wrap Styler 5 In 1','VNT-BTY-0255','VANTA BTY','beauty',26.00,NULL,80,'https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/hot-air-brush-5-in-1-84-390.jpg','Introducing the multi-talented Ceramic Air wrap Styler 5 In 1','Introducing the multi-talented Ceramic Air wrap Styler 5 In 1! Unleash your hair\'s potential with these amazing features: Material: Ceramic Power Source: Corded Electric Special Features: Massage, Blow, Hot, Comb Transform your locks effortlessly: Five interchangeable brush attachments for straightening, curling, volumizing, and scalp massaging Combining blow drying with styling brushes for versatile hair lengths and styles Say goodbye to frizz and static: Advanced negative ion technology and ceramic coating for smooth, static-free hair Nylon pin and tufted bristles to untangle and soothe your scalp Personalize your style with ease: 1000W power with 3 temperature controls for precise styling Suitable for all hair types and seasons, making every look achievable Convenience on the go: Lightweight design for easy portability and comfortable use Achieve salon-worthy results without the hassle Unleash the magic of 5-in-1 styling: Traditional hair dryer, straightener, curler, and hair comb, all rolled into one Elevate your hair game for every hair type and style Give the gift of perfect hair: Ideal for women and girls who cherish versatility and style Elevate your hair routine with the Ceramic Air