free Hair: Flaunt your hair with our Automatic Hair Curler. Its negative ions give hair a nourishing touch, reduce frizz, and create fluffy and soft hairstyles. The 32mm lazy big roll allows quick styling, making it perfect for lazy days. ?Harm-Reducing Curling: Our advanced hair curler locks in hair moisture with negative ions that protect each cuticle, reducing harm and friction for ultra-smooth, lasting curls. Say goodbye to frizz and hello to healthy-looking hair with every use.',0,0,1,'2026-11-25 07:29:31','[\"#831843\",\"#EC4899\",\"#FBCFE8\"]'),('627e466c-9ef6-44d9-adaf-4c25844038fb','Washing Machine Cleaner Pack Of','VNT-HME-0465','VANTA HME','home-decor',8.00,NULL,30,'[\"/uploads/vnt-hme-0465-img-1.webp\",\"/uploads/vnt-hme-0465-img-2.webp\"]','Washing Machine Cleaner Pack Of','Features: Universal Compatibility: Works with all washer types including high efficiency, standard toploaders, front loaders. Compatible with brands like GE, LG, Samsung, Whirlpool, Maytag, Electrolux. Eco-Friendly Tabs: Natural effervescent foaming tablets, septic safe, and minimal packaging. Reduces waste compared to liquid descalers and wipes. Instant Cleaning Power: Self-wash tablets clean without the need for brushing or wiping. Activated by water, they turn into deep scrubbing powder that removes grime and hard water buildup. Odor Eliminator: Freshens washer basket, rubber gasket, and internal parts to prevent odors. Ensures clothes come out clean and fresh smelling. Extended Cleaning: Time-release formula cleans deep inside pump, valve, tub, drum, agitator, filter, and hoses.',0,1,0,'2026-11-25 07:32:53','[\"#18181B\",\"#71717A\",\"#E4E4E7\"]'),('628dd332-9b71-4e61-b58d-f3ab28ce9aba','UNIQUE DESIGN','VNT-ELE-0010','VANTA ELE','electronics',63.00,50.00,30,'[\"/uploads/vnt-ele-0010-img-1.webp\",\"/uploads/vnt-ele-0010-img-2.webp\"]','UNIQUE DESIGN','UNIQUE DESIGN: Features a distinctive 2-tier structure with a towel rack and 3 hooks. Provides additional storage space, making your bathroom cleaner and more organized.2 TIER STORAGE OVER THE TOILET: Offers two levels of valuable storage space for towels, toilet paper, shampoo, and other toiletries, as well as potted plants.STABLE STRUCTURE: Constructed with thick stainless steel tubing, this shelf is rust-free, sturdy, and easy to clean. It includes non-slip feet for added stability and has a load capacity of 20kg.EASY ASSEMBLY: Comes with clear installation instructions, labeled parts, and included tools, allowing you to assemble the over-the-toilet bathroom organizer in just a few minutes.DIMENSIONS: Measures 50.5cm x 24.5cm x 139.5cm.',0,1,0,'2026-11-25 07:28:59','[\"#1E293B\",\"#3B82F6\",\"#93C5FD\"]'),('62f68dd5-a843-430b-bf77-42ae1151c4c1','Lightness & Cordless','VNT-HME-0449','VANTA HME','home-decor',39.00,30.00,79,'[\"/uploads/vnt-hme-0449-img-1.webp\",\"/uploads/vnt-hme-0449-img-2.webp\"]','Lightness & Cordless','Lightness & Cordless: This handheld vacuum is incredibly convenient for reaching tight spots, thanks to its lightweight and maneuverable design. Perfect for use in cars or anywhere else due to its portability. Long Lasting Battery: Rechargeable and quick to charge, this cordless car vacuum holds a charge for an extended period, making it ideal for tackling light cleaning tasks. Strong Enough Suction: With powerful suction, this Dustbuster hand vacuum effortlessly picks up debris, especially along carpet edges and walls. It makes cleaning faster and easier, ensuring a thorough job every time. Wide Application: Suitable for use on mattresses, sofas, upholstery, bedding, carpets, and rugs, this vacuum cleaner tackles areas where traditional vacuum cleaners may struggle. Vacuum Cleaner: A thoughtful gift for busy moms and wives, this smart device is a valuable addition to any family\'s cleaning arsenal.',0,0,0,'2026-11-25 07:32:48','[\"#451A03\",\"#B45309\",\"#FBBF24\"]'),('633e7dda-7e67-4823-ac67-2b909a9a972f','Vanta Beauty Signature Series #127','VNT-BTY-0127','VANTA BTY','beauty',24.00,20.00,82,'[\"/uploads/vnt-bty-0127-img-1.webp\",\"/uploads/vnt-bty-0127-img-2.webp\"]','Vanta Beauty Signature Series #127','If you struggle with skin imperfections that undermine your confidence, this is the most important article you’ll read this year.Finally, A Real Solution for Unwanted Skin ImperfectionsOver my career, I’ve consulted with thousands of individuals, many of whom felt like they were in a losing battle against their own skin. They came to me with a host of frustrating issues:– Embarrassing Skin Tags– Unsightly Moles– Stubborn Warts– Telltale Age & Dark SpotsI’ve seen how these small marks can cause a huge decline in self-esteem, making someone feel older than they are and disconnected from the person they see in the mirror.For years, the only real solutions were expensive, in-clinic procedures. But it wasn’t until I uncovered the real reason these imperfections appear that I finally found a way to help people take back control of their skin, safely and affordably, right from their own home.The Shocking Root Cause of Skin BlemishesWhat if those moles, skin tags, and dark spots aren’t just random signs of aging?The real issue may be something called “Epidermal Chaos.” In our youth, the skin naturally renews itself through a process called cellular turnover, which efficiently clears away dead cells and minor imperfections before they surface.Over time, however, aging, sun exposure, and daily stress slow this process down. The skin’s natural “cleanup crew” becomes overwhelmed, allowing small cellular glitches—like excess skin or pigment clusters—to linger. These eventually show up as skin tags, dark spots, or other blemishes that become permanent features.',0,0,0,'2026-11-25 07:29:24','[\"#1E293B\",\"#3B82F6\",\"#93C5FD\"]'),('6346416b-44ad-4325-8300-18341c027fc4','Restorative Nutrient Delivery','VNT-ELE-0016','VANTA ELE','electronics',58.00,50.00,36,'[\"/uploads/vnt-ele-0016-img-1.webp\",\"/uploads/vnt-ele-0016-img-2.webp\"]','Restorative N