ous and contemporary oral hygiene. About the brand:Marvis is a ‘heritage toothpaste’ which first came onto the market in the 1950s. When it comes to dental hygiene, you want the best for your teeth, not simply a fashion product - but Marvis deliver top quality dental hygiene alongside a striking visual style. How to use:1. Brush twice a day for at least two minutes each time.2. Use in conjunction with mouthwash.3. Use a soft or medium bristled toothbrush.4. Replace your toothbrush every 2-3 months.HighlightsWhitens and brightens teeth whilst preventing toothHelps in decay and fighting tartar and plaqueFeatures the sharp taste of cool mint for lasting freshnessHelps in fighting germs and prevent toothache',1,0,0,'2026-11-25 07:29:25','[\"#0F172A\",\"#334155\",\"#94A3B8\"]'),('9e2d71f6-1506-4eb7-98a9-89103df68da7','Haino Teko Mini G9 Smart Watch','VNT-WTC-0536','VANTA WTC','watches',105.00,83.00,36,'[\"/uploads/vnt-wtc-0536-img-1.webp\",\"/uploads/vnt-wtc-0536-img-2.webp\"]','Haino Teko Mini G9 Smart Watch','Product Name: Haino Teko G9 Mini Rose Gold Smart Watch Stylish Design: Sleek and elegant design, perfect for both casual and formal wear. Fitness Tracking: Monitor your daily activities including steps, distance, calories burned, and more to help you stay active and reach your fitness goals. Long Battery Life: Enjoy extended usage with the long-lasting battery, ensuring your smartwatch is ready whenever you need it. Sleep Monitoring: Track your sleep patterns and receive insights into your sleep quality, helping you improve your overall sleep habits. Rose Gold Edition: Featuring a luxurious rose gold finish, adding a touch of sophistication to your wrist. Notification Alerts: Stay connected with important notifications from your smartphone, including calls, messages, and app alerts, directly on your wrist.',0,0,1,'2026-11-25 07:39:35','[\"#312E81\",\"#6366F1\",\"#C7D2FE\"]'),('9eab4de3-a315-443e-b2d7-3e2dddb6844d','Facial Ice Roller for All Skin Types','VNT-BTY-02