e-sided tape for secure and long-lasting attachment. Transparent tapes leave no marks on the mirror when removing the lights. ???? Evenly Fill Light for Delicate Makeup: Hollywood style LED vanity mirror lights with 10 bulbs. Customizable combination of bulbs for even light distribution from multiple angles. Eliminates dark corners and shadows, ensuring clear and detailed makeup application. Ideal for avoiding the frustration of inadequate makeup caused by insufficient light.',0,0,0,'2026-11-25 07:29:47','[\"#312E81\",\"#6366F1\",\"#C7D2FE\"]'),('a46ce816-d50d-49c6-abc3-f30c61dce738','LED Light & Cordless Vacuum Product Name','VNT-ELE-0055','VANTA ELE','electronics',50.00,40.00,75,'[\"/uploads/vnt-ele-0055-img-1.webp\",\"/uploads/vnt-ele-0055-img-2.webp\"]','LED Light & Cordless Vacuum Product Name','LED Light & Cordless Vacuum Product Name: wireless Vacuum Cleaner Product Model: HY-118 Rated Power:120W Integrated Cup: 600ml Suction Power: 7500PA Product Size: 115*17cm Net Weight: 1050g Introducing the Fanadith handheld vacuum cleaner - a wireless marvel with a 15.35\" mini appearance and lightweight design, making it super convenient and highly portable. The built-in LED light illuminates dark corners, making it perfect for home and car cleaning. It\'s an ideal gift for birthdays, Thanksgiving, and Valentine\'s Day, sure to delight family, friends, and loved ones. With no bulky wires to deal with, simply charge it anywhere using the USB power cord. ????7500PA Strong Suction Vacuum???? Prepare to be amazed by the power of the Fanadith handheld vacuum! Its robust 120W high-power motor delivers an impressive 7500pa suction force, outperforming ordinary car vacuum cleaners on the market. Effortlessly tackle hair, debris, liquid, dust, bread crumbs, pet hair, and cat litter in hard-to-reach gaps. It\'s the ultimate tool for quick and efficient cleaning in both your home and car. Upgraded HEPA Filter Equipped with an upgraded washable HEPA filter, this mini vacuum can capture an impressive 99.99% of particles, effectively protecting the motor and preventing secondary air pollution. Emptying the dust container is a cinch - just rotate it to dispose of the trash and then rinse it under water for cleaning and drying. 4 in 1 Clean Professional Accessories The cordless hand vacuum comes with an array of versatile accessories to meet all your cleaning needs. The package includes 1dusting brush, 1crevice nozzle tool, 1hose, 1 washable filter, 1floor brush, and 2connect tools. These attachments enable you to reach narrow gaps, corners, and difficult-to-access areas. The brush is perfect for carpets and pet hair, while the long hose can tackle hidden and deep corners in cars and warehouses. The floor brush takes care of floors and curtains, making it a comprehensive solution for both home and car cleaning.',0,1,0,'2026-11-25 07:29:08','[\"#1E293B\",\"#3B82F6\",\"#93C5FD\"]'),('a476d53a-37b8-438e-9449-2d6c39dd4287','Cup Holder Food Tray','VNT-ELE-0086','VANTA ELE','electronics',42.00,33.00,41,'[\"/uploads/vnt-ele-0086-img-1.webp\",\"/uploads/vnt-ele-0086-img-2.webp\"]','Cup Holder Food Tray','Material: - This car cup holder from our Y.Z Union store is made of thick ABS plastic, strong and stable after installation. It fits regular sized cans, water bottle and juice boxes up to 6.3 inches in diameter in middle and fits. 3 in 1: – There are 1 little food tray / storage table in middle, 2 drink bottle holders on sides, and 1 phone holder with silicone anti slip in ONE set, for different needs. Wherever there is a cup holder hole, no matter in horizontal, vertical, or special shaped, you can have it installed without effort. Great for organizing items, such as cups, foods, drinks, cards, pens, keys and wallet, and enjoy video shows while dinning in the car. Swiveling Design: – Our travel tray organizer is designed with swivel capabilities, 2 drinking holders can be rotated in 360° and 2 jointed arms in180°. It will allow you to adjust the cup ho