cord for easy one-hand operation. PORTABLE AND GOOD QUALITY - Unique and perfect seasonal gift - portable and good quality, it can be a good gift to your friends, parents, family, elder for their health life.',0,0,0,'2026-11-25 07:33:06','[\"#18181B\",\"#71717A\",\"#E4E4E7\"]'),('fd9d602c-72ce-4559-8692-f6106526684e','Powerful Magnetic Grip','VNT-ELE-0002','VANTA ELE','electronics',12.00,10.00,22,'[\"/uploads/vnt-ele-0002-img-1.webp\",\"/uploads/vnt-ele-0002-img-2.webp\"]','Powerful Magnetic Grip','Powerful Magnetic Grip – Built with upgraded magnets to hold your phone securely.Vacuum Suction Cup – Strong suction base provides a stable hold on dashboards, windshields, glass, and other smooth surfaces.Adjustable Rotation – Ball joint design allows easy adjustment for the perfect viewing angle during navigation or calls.Compatibility – Works with all smartphones, including iPhone, Samsung Galaxy, Huawei, Google Pixel, and more (metal ring included).Easy to Install & Remove – One-step lock system for quick setup; leaves no residue when removed. Compact and stylish design fits any car interior.',0,0,0,'2026-11-25 07:28:59','[\"#065F46\",\"#10B981\",\"#A7F3D0\"]'),('fe17133e-185d-4f63-8398-0d6983dcfe77','Introducing the Gel Cushion','VNT-HME-0397','VANTA HME','home-decor',17.00,14.00,27,'[\"/uploads/vnt-hme-0397-img-1.webp\",\"/uploads/vnt-hme-0397-img-2.webp\"]','Introducing the Gel Cushion','Introducing the Gel Cushion , Generation 1 900G, designed to provide the ultimate comfort and relief! Experience the bliss of advanced column-buckling technology that evenly disperses body weight, banishing uncomfortable pressure points. The innovative gel cooling structure ensures a refreshing airflow to keep your bottom cool even during long sits. Crafted from medical-grade gel material, this cushion maintains its shape and support, delivering unwavering comfort over time. The non-slip friction bead grip bottom keeps it securely in place. Take comfort on the go with built-in carry handles! Easily switch between home, office, car, airplane, wheelchair, and more. And when it\'s time for a refresh, simply unzip the cover for easy cleaning. Say goodbye to pain! Whether it\'s coccyx issues, lumbar strain, sciatica, or degenerative disc disorders, our cushion offers relief. It\'s the gift that keeps on giving – a thoughtful present for loved ones dealing with cervical spine pain. Discover the world of comfort with!',0,0,0,'2026-11-25 07:32:34','[\"#1E293B\",\"#3B82F6\",\"#93C5FD\"]'),('fe1c3327-3dda-4581-9ef8-ebd6618ad446','Imageye Imgi Etnma5pxx8x2c62mchdrjwd8 Extralarge','VNT-WTC-0519','VANTA WTC','watches',45.00,NULL,84,'[\"/uploads/vnt-wtc-0519-img-1.webp\",\"/uploads/vnt-wtc-0519-img-2.webp\"]','Imageye Imgi Etnma5pxx8x2c62mchdrjwd8 Extralarge','Imageye Imgi Etnma5pxx8x2c62mchdrjwd8 Extralarge is crafted with superior craftsmanship, designed to bring modern aesthetic and reliable functionality to your everyday lifestyle in the UAE.',0,0,0,'2026-11-25 07:33:16','[\"#18181B\",\"#71717A\",\"#E4E4E7\"]'),('fe3385ec-d52c-4ed8-a150-70fab7473005','Network Connections:','VNT-ELE-0089','VANTA ELE','electronics',62.00,48.00,44,'[\"/uploads/vnt-ele-0089-img-1.webp\",\"/uploads/vnt-ele-0089-img-2.webp\"]','Network Connections:','Unleash your inner spy with ECSEM\'s tiny yet powerful Digital Video Camcorder Wired connectivity ensures a secure and reliable connection for your covert operations Doubles as a discreet web camera for confidential online video chats High-resolution image capture at 2.0M pixels with low illumination for stealthy recording Flexible recording options with manual and sound-activated modes at 720480/30 and 320240/30 frames per second High-speed recording to capture every crucial moment in your mission Battery-powered for ultimate portability, with a built-in Li rechargeable battery lasting 1.5 hours Impressive standby time of up to 250 hours ensures you\'re always ready for action Supports AVI video format for easy playback and compatibility with various devices Compact design with an included AC charger, making it the perfect companion for on-the-go espionage Network Connections: WiFi 2.4GHz: Stable and reliable wireless connection Power Supply: Efficient Power Supply: Ensures your camera is always ready to monitor Stunning Video Quality: 2K Video Resolution: Record videos in clear 2K resolution 130% More Pixels: Superior detail and clarity compared to other models 130° Wide Angle: Broad field of view for comprehensive coverage Live View and Recordings: View live videos and recordings on your phone using WiFi or mobile data Note: This device does not support audio recording due to regulations Continuous Recording: Loop Recording: Automatically overwrites old files to ensure continuous recording Note: Recordings are made without audio due to regulations Smart Motion Detection: Advanced Motion Sensor: Detects movement and triggers recording Alerts: Sends notifications to your phone and email when motion is detected Adjustable Settings: Customize sensitivity and detection zones to suit your needs Peace of Mind: Protect Your Family and Property: Monitor babysitters, children, staff, and deter thieves Discreet and Effective: Install these small cameras to keep an eye on your home or workplace',0,0,0,'2026-11-25 07:29:14','[\"#451A03\",\"#B45309\",\"#FBBF24\"]'),('fe3865fc-dd42-4a4d-9b8c-b1e62559e764','Rechargeable Folding Fan','VNT-ELE-0271','VANTA ELE','electronics',12.00,10.00,31,'https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/rechargeable-folding-fan-595-077.jpg','Rechargeable Folding Fan','Retractable, foldable, convenient to carry, with USB charging Curved large fan blade design, uniformly cutting air, powerful wind, up to 2 m/s, variable speed DC, brushless motor, stable and periodic variable speed, providing stable and strong power, simulating natural wind, low noise, low power consumption, quiet and comfortable Simple button operation, 3 levels of wind power can be adjusted, click to switch wind speed 2000mAh large-capacity battery, lasting 6-8 hours of battery life The front cover net is detachable, the fan blades can be wiped, and it is easy to clean',0,0,0,'2026-11-25 07:29:45','[\"#1E293B\",\"#3B82F6\",\"#93C5FD\"]'),('fe946be2-bb7f-4689-9882-96ba1241cf58','Stainless Steel Attachments','VNT-HME-0472','VANTA HME','home-decor',18.00,15.00,37,'[\"/uploads/vnt-hme-0472-img-1.webp\",\"/uploads/vnt-hme-0472-img-2.webp\"]','Stainless Steel Attachments','Stainless Steel Attachments — Get 2 X dough hooks for effortless dough and cake mix mixing , and 2 X beaters for egg white whipping and light cake batters. Seven Variable Speed Settings — This hand mixer offers 1 to 7speed settings, plus a turbo function, to handle everything from blending dry flour ???? to mashing ingredients . Comfort Grip and Easy Eject Button — With its ergonomic grip, this lightweight mixer ensures comfortable operation. When you\'re done, simply adjust the speed to 0, press the eject button, and the attachments pop off effortlessly. Easy to Clean and Multi-purpose — All attachments are dishwasher-safe , and a single damp cloth is enough to clean it. This electric hand mixer can blend, beat, whip, knead, and mix eggs or cream for a convenient and safe user experience. Perfect Kitchen Accessory — It\'s the ultimate assistant for crafting desserts, cakes, and baked goods. A fantastic value for your kitchen adventures!',0,0,1,'2026-11-25 07:32:56','[\"#78350F\",\"#F59E0B\",\"#FDE68A\"]'),('ff7e400e-6432-4e7c-b4bf-73ee806fce5b','Vanta Beauty Signature Series #111','VNT-BTY-0111','VANTA BTY','beauty',15.00,NULL,66,'[\"/uploads/vnt-bty-0111-img-1.webp\",\"/uploads/vnt-bty-0111-img-2.webp\"]','Vanta Beauty Signature Series #111','TRANSFORMATIVE CLAY TO BUBBLES - Starts as a rich clay pack and transforms into fluffy, carbonated bubbles within minutes. The bubbling action deeply cleanses your skin, offering a fun, spa-like experience in the comfort of your home. PORE & BLACKHEAD DEEP CLEANSING – Infused with Carbonated Water, Holy Basil Extract and PHA, this bubble mask effectively targets stubborn blackheads and cleanses deep within your pores while controlling excess sebum. Leaves your skin smooth, clean, and refreshed after every use. GENTLE FORMULA FOR ALL SKIN - Made with natural ingredients and free from 20 known harmful ingredients and artificial additives. Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive and acne-prone skin. CLINICALLY PROVEN RESULTS – Clinically tested to cleanse pores by 23% and reduce blackheads and sebum by 55%, all while remaining gentle and non-irritating to all types of skin.',0,0,0,'2026-11-25 07:29:22','[\"#831843\",\"#EC4899\",\"#FBCFE8\"]'),('ffd60134-220f-4154-98f3-b23378e09498','Enhanced Recognition','VNT-ELE-0073','VANTA ELE','electronics',58.00,45.00,28,'[\"/uploads/vnt-ele-0073-img-1.webp\",\"/uploads/vnt-ele-0073-img-2.webp\"]','Enhanced Recognition','Enhanced Recognition: Improved fingerprint recognition rate by 30% for faster and more accurate unlocking. Multiple Users: Stores up to 20 fingerprints, perfect for shared access with family or team members. Convenient Charging: Features a Type-C charging interface for fast and efficient power-ups. One-Touch Unlocking: Quick and hassle-free access with just a touch of your finger—no keys or combinations needed. Long Battery Life: Fully charged battery supports months of standby time, minimizing the need for frequent charging. Versatile Usage: Ideal for securing lockers, luggage, doors, backpacks, gym bags, and more. Advanced Security: Eliminates risks of losing keys or forgetting combinations for worry-free protection. Eco-Friendly: Energy-efficient design that saves power while delivering exceptional performance. Compact & Sleek: Portable design that’s both stylish and easy to carry anywhere.',0,0,0,'2026-11-25 07:29:12','[\"#1E293B\",\"#3B82F6\",\"#93C5FD\"]');
