ery life deliver an unmatched listening experience for audio enthusiasts.\",\"specs\":{\"Driver Size\":\"40mm Dynamic\",\"Connectivity\":\"Bluetooth 5.2 / 3.5mm Jack\",\"Battery Life\":\"Up to 40 hours (ANC Off)\",\"Charging Port\":\"USB Type-C\",\"Weight\":\"250g\"},\"reviews\":[{\"id\":101,\"name\":\"Alex Mercer\",\"rating\":5,\"date\":\"2026-07-20\",\"comment\":\"Best headphones I have ever owned. The active noise cancellation is flawless!\"},{\"id\":102,\"name\":\"Sarah Connor\",\"rating\":4.5,\"date\":\"2026-07-25\",\"comment\":\"Super comfortable for long hours. Sound quality is rich, though bass is slightly heavy.\"}],\"isFeatured\":true,\"isBestSeller\":true,\"isNewArrival\":false},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"AeroWatch Series 4 Smartwatch\",\"brand\":\"AeroSound\",\"category\":\"electronics\",\"price\":349.99,\"discountPrice\":349.99,\"discountPercentage\":0,\"rating\":4.6,\"reviewsCount\":92,\"stock\":8,\"images\":[\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523275335684-37898b6baf30?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80\",\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542496658-e33a6d0d50f6?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80\"],\"colors\":[\"#000000\",\"#D69E2E\",\"#3182CE\"],\"sizes\":[\"41mm\",\"45mm\"],\"description\":\"Stay connected, active, and healthy with AeroWatch Series 4. Featuring an Always-On Retina display, blood oxygen tracking, ECG monitoring, and auto-workout detection, it is the ultimate companion on your wrist.\",\"specs\":{\"Display\":\"Always-On Retina OLED\",\"Water Resistance\":\"WR50 (50 meters)\",\"Sensors\":\"ECG, Heart Rate, Blood Oxygen, Gyroscope\",\"Battery Life\":\"Up to 18 hours\",\"Compatibility\":\"iOS & Android\"},\"reviews\":[{\"id\":103,\"name\":\"David Miller\",\"rating\":4,\"date\":\"2026-06-12\",\"comment\":\"Great fitness features, but I wish the battery lasted longer than a day.\"},{\"id\":104,\"name\":\"Emily Rose\",\"rating\":5,\"date\":\"2026-07-18\",\"comment\":\"Beautiful screen and super fast. Swapping bands is incredibly simple.\"}],\"isFea