extile strap)\",\"Weight\":\"55g\"},\"reviews\":[{\"id\":116,\"name\":\"Coach K.\",\"rating\":5,\"date\":\"2026-07-11\",\"comment\":\"Crucial tool for zone training. Syncs instantly with my Garmin.\"}],\"isFeatured\":false,\"isBestSeller\":false,\"isNewArrival\":false},{\"id\":15,\"name\":\"HyperGrip Recover Massage Gun\",\"brand\":\"FlexiFit\",\"category\":\"wellness\",\"price\":199.99,\"discountPrice\":169.99,\"discountPercentage\":15,\"rating\":4.9,\"reviewsCount\":95,\"stock\":14,\"images\":[\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600881333168-2ef49b341f30?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80\",\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519501025264-65ba15a82390?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80\"],\"colors\":[\"#2D3748\"],\"sizes\":[\"Standard\"],\"description\":\"Recover faster and move better. The HyperGrip percussive therapy device targets sore muscles with rapid pulses to relieve tension, stimulate blood flow, and break down lactic acid. Features a ultra-quiet brushless motor.\",\"specs\":{\"Speed Settings\":\"5 speed levels (1800 - 3200 percussions/min)\",\"Stall Force\":\"Up to 45 lbs\",\"Battery Life\":\"Up to 3 hours (Rechargeable Li-ion)\",\"Attachments\":\"5 interchangeable head accessories\",\"Noise Level\":\"Quiet Glide tech (45dB - 55dB)\"},\"reviews\":[{\"id\":117,\"name\":\"Brad P.\",\"rating\":5,\"date\":\"2026-07-27\",\"comment\":\"Excellent battery life, very powerful. Highly effective after heavy squat days.\"}],\"isFeatured\":true,\"isBestSeller\":true,\"isNewArrival\":true},{\"id\":16,\"name\":\"Vacuum Insulated Stainless Straw Bottle\",\"brand\":\"FlexiFit\",\"category\":\"wellness\",\"price\":39.99,\"discountPrice\":34.99,\"discountPercentage\":13,\"rating\":4.7,\"reviewsCount\":340,\"stock\":45,\"images\":[\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1602143407151-7111542de6e8?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80\",\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523362628745-0c100150b504?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80\"],\"colors\":[\"#319795\",\"#2B6CB0\",\"#1A202C\",\"#E53E3